Dialogue: 2,0:00:06.82,0:01:28.04,Header,,0,0,0,,H012  •  現在完了進行形（have/has been ＋ -ing）
Dialogue: 2,0:00:06.82,0:00:12.26,English,,0,0,0,,For three years I have been practicing the piano every morning.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:12.26,0:00:16.72,English,,0,0,0,,My daily effort has slowly been paying off.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:16.72,0:00:22.58,English,,0,0,0,,I have been working on a single piece of music for a long time.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:22.58,0:00:25.38,English,,0,0,0,,Every day, I have continued to practice.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:25.38,0:00:29.88,English,,0,0,0,,Sometimes I have struggled, but I have never stopped.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:31.48,0:00:34.70,English,,0,0,0,,I used to be unable to play fast.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:34.70,0:00:40.56,English,,0,0,0,,In the past my fingers would tangle and the notes would break.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:41.74,0:00:47.14,English,,0,0,0,,Lately, however, my fingers have been moving in a steady way.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:47.14,0:00:51.18,English,,0,0,0,,I have become devoted to shaping every sound.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:52.46,0:00:57.96,English,,0,0,0,,My playing has gradually been improving, and my ability has been developing.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:57.96,0:01:03.34,English,,0,0,0,,For several months now, I have noticed slow but steady growth in myself.
Dialogue: 2,0:01:03.34,0:01:08.20,English,,0,0,0,,Today, I accomplished something important.
Dialogue: 2,0:01:08.20,0:01:17.70,English,,0,0,0,,At a small recital, I played all the way to the last note without stopping.
Dialogue: 2,0:01:18.82,0:01:27.84,English,,0,0,0,,That small achievement was the quiet result of all the time I had spent practicing.
Dialogue: 2,0:01:29.34,0:01:35.08,Title,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,465)}H012  
